// Tags go at the end of the line.

== fixture.tags
mira: I'm #winning today.
//        ^^^^^^^^ PIB1201
mira: Hi. #thought and more
//        ^^^^^^^^ PIB1201
-> Go #show_disabled @once
//    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB1201
mira: [b]I'm #winning[/b]
//           ^^^^^^^^ PIB1201
mira: {if $a}I'm #winning{/if}
//               ^^^^^^^^ PIB1201

// Must not trigger

mira: I'm \#winning today. #thought
mira: [b]I'm \#winning[/b] #thought
mira: {if $a}I'm \#winning{/if} #thought
mira: My #1 fan. #thought #box:phone
-> Go  @once #show_disabled
mira: Hi. #thought // a comment after a tag
-> Go @once #show_disabled // a comment after the modifier and tag
